### 1. List all available models across channels
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/models HTTP/1.1

### 2. List available models filtered by channel
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/models?channel=beta HTTP/1.1

### 3. List available models filtered by quantization
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/models?quantized=true HTTP/1.1

### 4. List available models with client app compatibility check
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/models?app=1.0.0&current=2026.01.01 HTTP/1.1

### 5. Get descriptor for a specific bundle version (beta / 2026.09.04)
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/models/beta/2026.09.04 HTTP/1.1

### 6. Get release index
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/models/index.json HTTP/1.1

### 7. One-round-trip update check (latest only)
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/models/check?channel=beta&current=2026.01.01&app=1.0.0 HTTP/1.1

### 8. Admin - Import bundle
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/admin/bundles/import HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "source_path": "dist/bundle_v1_quant.zip", 
    "channel": "beta", 
    "quantized": true, 
    "promote": false, 
    "allow_unsigned": true, 
    "changelog": ["first beta drop", "seg_lung retrained"]
}

### 9. Admin - Promote bundle
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/admin/channels/beta/promote HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "version": "2026.09.04"
}
